{"unit_id":"fashionmascherine-svg__formalswarm#feature-1","repo":"fashionmascherine-svg/formalswarm","commit":"458719d2d89948d9847ff5ff13ca9a64c679f404","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"FormalSwarm 的功能「并行辩论与验证」：多个提案者独立产出分析，批评者分区提出异议，验证者执行检查，工作流根据结果汇总结论。通过 workflow 工具或跨运行时驱动器启动。","source":"generated","evidence":["core/debate.workflow.js:3-16","core/driver.js:3-20"]}
{"unit_id":"fashionmascherine-svg__formalswarm#feature-2","repo":"fashionmascherine-svg/formalswarm","commit":"458719d2d89948d9847ff5ff13ca9a64c679f404","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"FormalSwarm 的功能「构建验证 brief」：命令行读取目标仓库配置、上下文文件和用户给定的检查命令，生成包含提示词与规模参数的 JSON brief。使用 brief 子命令触发，并可设置轮数和调用预算。","source":"generated","evidence":["core/bin/formalswarm.js:132-177","core/brief.js:108-130"]}
{"unit_id":"fashionmascherine-svg__formalswarm#feature-3","repo":"fashionmascherine-svg/formalswarm","commit":"458719d2d89948d9847ff5ff13ca9a64c679f404","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"FormalSwarm 的功能「无 workflow 运行时驱动」：在缺少 workflow 工具的环境中，驱动器生成待执行的阶段提示，主会话保存各智能体答案后继续运行，最终写出 outcome.json。","source":"generated","evidence":["core/driver.js:14-20","core/driver.js:41-46"]}
{"unit_id":"fashionmascherine-svg__formalswarm#feature-4","repo":"fashionmascherine-svg/formalswarm","commit":"458719d2d89948d9847ff5ff13ca9a64c679f404","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"FormalSwarm 的功能「仓库配置探测」：init 和 status 命令通过配置模块识别目标仓库并创建或读取项目配置，brief 命令再使用该配置填充测试命令等信息。","source":"generated","evidence":["core/bin/formalswarm.js:103-129","core/profile.js:148-181"]}
